 & \multicolumn{3}{c}{Inception $Q_0$ geometry at $(\alpha=0,\beta=1)$} & \multicolumn{2}{c}{$U_{v,H}$ $\widehat{\mathrm{Corr}}(\hat\alpha,\hat\beta)$} & \multicolumn{2}{c}{L2 $\widehat{\mathrm{Corr}}(\hat\alpha,\hat\beta)$} \\
